WEBVTT

00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:01.060
Disk full.

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:01.773
Mac slow.

00:00:01.773 --> 00:00:04.708
And the cleaner wants a subscription.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.978
What if cleaning your Mac
were free, and open source?

00:00:09.978 --> 00:00:11.329
This is MacleanFy.

00:00:12.433 --> 00:00:14.413
One screen shows your Mac's health,

00:00:14.413 --> 00:00:17.579
the space you can reclaim and
what you've already freed.

00:00:18.267 --> 00:00:23.847
Smart clean sweeps 17 categories:
caches, logs, developer leftovers,

00:00:23.847 --> 00:00:25.816
browsers and duplicates.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.019
Only what's safe comes ticked, and nothing
leaves your disk until you confirm.

00:00:31.733 --> 00:00:34.729
Find out where your space
went, folder by folder,

00:00:34.729 --> 00:00:37.297
and send what you don't need to the Trash.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:43.878
The uninstaller removes an app along with its
Library leftovers and the services it installed.

00:00:44.567 --> 00:00:45.223
Mac slow?

00:00:45.223 --> 00:00:50.836
See processor, memory, network and
battery live, and what's weighing it down.

00:00:51.533 --> 00:00:55.504
And maintenance that used to
need Terminal is now one button.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:56.895
MacleanFy.

00:00:56.895 --> 00:00:58.354
Free and open source.

00:00:58.354 --> 00:00:58.910
Like it?

00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:02.731
Head to GitHub and leave a
star to support the project.
